Printing-HOWTO by Grant Taylor. It covers the installation of printers and
print services and gives an overview of programs which create output on the
printer (e.g. Ghostscript). For further informations about printing on a
running system see the Printing-Usage-HOWTO, which will soon be available
in a German translation as well.
The DE-Drucker-HOWTO is available from the following ftp-servers:

  ftp.uni-stuttgart.de:/pub/systems/linux/local/doc
  ftp.heise.de:/pub
  evtl. ftp.sunsite.unc.edu and its mirrors.

Because it is written using the Linuxdoc-SGML-package, the HOWTO is available
in TXT, HTML, DVI, PS and PDF.
You can also view it in the WWW at

  http://hp00.rz.tu-harburg.de/users/semb2204/dlhp/DE-Drucker-HOWTO.html

