email via POP3 and SMTP.

This is the last release of News Peruser that will use the XForms
library for its interface. As it stands, Peruser is messy and needs
rewriting, and the forms library is not freeware, so I'm rewriting
Peruser in C++ using Bruce Wampler's V application framework, which is
LGPL. 

