handle multi-part MIME via a GUI interface to Frank Pilhofer's
uudeview package. It will also feature a GNU autoconf script to ease
compilation. Don't hold your breath waiting for it, I have a real job
that has nothing to do with Linux, and fiction writing to take up most
of my time.

