   right onto Smoky Hill, cross Chambers (a light), and then
   turn right at Laredo (a stop light), then left into the
   School parking lot. Go past the main entrance, and to the
   activities entrance.  There will be signs posted in the
   building to direct you to the room where we meet.

This newsletter is compiled by Michael J. Hammel <mjhammel@csn.net>,
   who welcomes comments on its form and content.

