Version:	0.6
Entered-date:	01SEP96
Description:	A sampling utility for cdrom drives that are capable
		of sending audio cd data in digital form to your host.
		Data can be dumped into wav or sun format sound files.
		Options control the recording format (stereo/mono; 
		8,12,16 bits; different rates).
