suggestions.  If you've got an idea, e-mail me at the address below and
I'll post it on the mailing list.

    1.  The Workman Database Project - This is an ongoing project to
    maintain a working database of CD titles for the popular X-Windows
    CD player, workman.  To find out more, send email to the address
    below.  As this was my idea, I'm volunteering to maintain this until
    such time that someone else wants to volunteer for it.

    2.  Your idea here.  Get in on the ground floor!  What will you get
    out of it.  Same as the rest of us.  Headaches, love/hate-mail, and
    notoriety.

