This program was recently revised by an anonymous author. I tried the new
version, made some changes, and sent them to the original author. However,
he no longer wants to maintain aumix and turned the job over to me. The
new release is at the places listed in the LSM below, thanks to the
folks at sunsite who moved it after only four hours, and on a holiday too! 

What's new since version 1.0:
        - fewer colors and no border to simplify full-screen interface
        - knobs are highlighted as you move to them, then brighten and
          leave a trail behind when you adjust them
	- controls which won't work are no longer drawn, to simplify the
	  display
        - horizontal knobs drawn with same characters as vertical ones
        - vertical controls spaced more closely so they fit in 80
          columns
        - use of "<" and ">" for cursor motion, and "q" to quit program
        - use of tab, "+" and "-" keys now shown on help line
        - added -h option to display usage

What's new since version 0.2:

        - added command-line interface

