Some time ago I asked (in a posting with much other stuff),
whether you, the readers of this newsgroup, would like to have
commercial advertisments for Linux-related hardware in this
group. I've only received a few responses, and I don't feel
comfortable about making a decision yet. I will therefore make
a poll.

This is not a vote. It's a poll. However, it _will_ influence
my decision. If one side gets a clear majority, I will almost
certainly obey the wishes of that majority. If not, I'll do
as I please. Also, I'm always more easily convinced by good
arguments than the mere number of supporters, so don't hesitate
to make up some.

Please send me (at liw@iki.fi) your opinion about whether
hardware advertisments should be allowed in this group. To make
it easier for me to understand your opinion, please begin your
reply with one of the following sentences (but only if they
apply to you, of course):

	I don't want hardware advertisments.
	I want hardware advertisments.
	Here's a million dollars and a faster Alpha than Linus has,
		please allow hardware advertisments.[1]

I won't be counting the replies automatically, so it doesn't
matter if you get the wording exact. If you aren't sure or
don't want to say what your opinion is, but still want to send
me some comments, go ahead.

I propose the following criteria for the hardware ads if they
are accepted at all:

         a) only the manufacturer posts, resellers are not welcome (this 
                already applies to all commercial posts)
         b) the system comes with Linux installed, or with a Linux
                 distribution bundled, or has some other reason why
                 it is of special interest for the group ("nice hardware"
                 is not enough; "nice hardware with Linux" might be)
         c) the posts don't get too frequent (read: I don't want every
                 hole-in-the-wall seller that assembles his own machines
                 to start posting, since in Helsinki, Finland alone there
                 would be a dozen or so of them)

As for all announcements, they should contain more content
than hype.

Lars Wirzenius, your moderator.

[1] Oh yes, I can be bribed. A million dollars per ad is enough. :)

