elaborate usage controls and automate common administrative tasks. 

Since its inception (originally as a package called "BBSutil"), Dial-Up
Utils has matured into a package I can be proud of.  I am not proud of it
because of its immense complexity (most of the code is trivial), but
because of its usefulness.  I am looking forward to hearing more
suggestions from users and adding even more cool features.

